Hyperscaler 100k/yr, PKG-A: ASP 330, factory 162, CM margin 19, warranty reserve 3 % 10 -> our gross profit 139/plate = US$13.9 M/yr (42 %)
Hyperscaler 100k/yr, C2: ASP 330, factory 141, CM margin 17, warranty reserve 3 % 10 -> our gross profit 162/plate = US$16.2 M/yr (49 %)
opex after qualification ~US$5.0 M/yr (engineering, BD, quality, insurance US$0.3-0.6 M, IP reserve) -> break-even ~33k plates/yr at ~US$150 gross profit
